"whose gravity leans 15 degrees off vertical -- the ``tilted`` scene of "
"``examples/feature_simulate``, which for sliding is a ramp with no edge "
"-- for ten seconds in MuJoCo, through the MJCF exporter and the "
"simulation of `partcad-sim-mujoco <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-"
"sim-mujoco>`_, with nothing changed but the sliding friction both blocks "
